---
kind: scene
id: board.close
title: The Hearing Rises
when: "@filed"
after: 'visited("rock.report")'
---

## The Hearing Room

// `inquest` is `judge: before`: the reconstruction's `until` objectives are
// already judged when this scene plays, so it can read the Board's verdict.
<match on="quest.reconstruction.state">
  <when is="complete">
    @chair{code="0010"}: The Board accepts the inspector's reconstruction in full.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @chair{code="0020" when="quest.reconstruction.objectives.fate.failed"}: The Board does not accept the finding on the manner of death.
    @chair{code="0030" when="quest.reconstruction.objectives.whoWasThere.failed"}: The Board does not accept the account of who was on the rock.
    @chair{code="0040" when="quest.reconstruction.objectives.whoLied.failed"}: The Board does not accept the finding on whose statement was false.
    @chair{code="0050"}: The Board finds the reconstruction unsafe and returns an open verdict.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@chair{code="0060"}: The inquiry will rise.
::set{run.fileClosed = true}
